/T (The "uniqueness" of De Zerbi's style that Guardiola highlights is multifaceted. It is rooted in a philosophy that values the ball not just as a tool to score goals but as the centerpiece of a larger, more intricate game of spatial manipulation and timing. This philosophy manifests in Brighton's gameplay, which is marked by an ability to pass the ball with purpose and precision, constantly seeking the free man, and exploiting spaces with meticulously timed movements. This requires players to possess not only technical proficiency but also a high level of tactical intelligence and spatial awareness, attributes that De Zerbi has successfully instilled in his team.)
/E (The "uniqueness" of De Zerbi's style that Guardiola highlights is multifaceted. It is rooted in a philosophy that values the ball not just as a tool to score goals but as the centerpiece of a larger, more intricate game of spatial manipulation and timing. This philosophy manifests in Brighton's gameplay, which is marked by an ability to pass the ball with purpose and precision, constantly seeking the free man, and exploiting spaces with meticulously timed movements. This requires players to possess not only technical proficiency but also a high level of tactical intelligence and spatial awareness, attributes that De Zerbi has successfully instilled in his team.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
